flowchart TD
    A[📲 User Downloads App<br>Play Store / App Store / Web] --> B[🎨 Splash Screen]
    B --> C{Already Registered?}
    
    C -->|No| D[✍️ Sign Up]
    C -->|Yes| E[🔐 Log In]
    
    D --> F[📱 Enter Mobile / Email]
    F --> G[🔑 Set Password]
    G --> H[📨 Verify OTP]
    H --> I[📋 Business Profile Setup<br>Name, GST, Address, Logo]
    
    I --> J[📂 Data Import?]
    J -->|Yes| K[📤 Upload CSV / Excel]
    J -->|No| L[📊 Skip to Dashboard]
    K --> L
    
    L --> M[🎯 Onboarding Tour (Optional)]
    M --> N[⚙️ Download AI Model?]
    N -->|Yes (Wi-Fi)| O[📥 Background Download<br>~2GB Phi-3 Model]
    N -->|No| P[⏩ Use Basic Features Only]
    O --> Q[🧠 Full AI Enabled]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[🏆 Dashboard Ready!]
    
    style R fill:#81c784,stroke:#1b5e20